01:12:51.645 --> 01:12:55.523
That's not that's not how it happened That's not how it happened.
不是这样的，不是这样的！事情不是这样的！

01:12:55.523 --> 01:13:21.710
That's not how it happened by Craig Thomas and also if you're feeling Generous, please go to how we made your mother calm make a difference and donate to Dr. Grossfeld's work He as is a real hero and has been to Craig's family and so many others And, yeah, thank you for listening, tell your friends, join us next week, we're thrilled to be making our way through this show with you, and thanks for joining us, and we'll see you next time.
由克雷格·托马斯（Craig Thomas）著作的《事情不是这样的》（That's Not How It Happened）！另外，如果你手头宽裕，请访问 HowWeMadeYourMother.com 点击“做出改变”，为格罗斯菲尔德医生的研究捐款。他是一位真正的英雄，对克雷格的家庭以及许多其他人来说都是如此。还有，谢谢你们的收听，告诉你的朋友们，下周继续收看我们，我们很高兴能和大家一起看完这部剧，感谢大家的加入，我们下期再见。

